---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import Breadcrumbs from "../components/Breadcrumbs.astro";
import ConceptSlot from "../components/ConceptSlot.astro";
import CtaBand from "../components/CtaBand.astro";
import { site } from "../data/site";
---

<Base
  title="About Andre Preer | Kitchens & Landscape in Springfield, IL"
  description="Andre M. Preer II remodels kitchens and builds landscape and stonework in Springfield and Central Illinois. How he looks at a property, without a brochure biography."
>
  <main id="main">
    <section>
      <div class="wrap">
        <Breadcrumbs crumbs={[{ name: "Home", href: "/" }, { name: "About", href: "/about/" }]} />
        <p class="eyebrow">The person you are calling</p>
        <h1>{site.person}</h1>
        <p class="lede">
          Andre Preer works on houses in {site.area} in two places: the kitchen, and the grounds. Inside, that is remodels, backsplash, cabinets, countertops, islands, and finishing. Outside, it is planting, limestone, patios, fire features, and specialty stone.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="tight">
      <div class="wrap split">
        <ConceptSlot
          id="house-exterior"
          label="Design concept"
          alt="Brick ranch house with a lawn, a shade tree, and foundation shrubs. Design concept, not a finished project and not an address."
        />
        <div class="prose">
          <h2>How a property gets read</h2>
          <p>
            The first useful hour is in the room or on the site. In a kitchen, that means how you cook, what you are willing to move, and which cabinets or counters are worth keeping. Outside, it means sun, grade, views, and the parts of the yard already worth keeping.
          </p>
          <h2>One scope, then the build</h2>
          <p>
            The plan is not handed from a drawing to a separate crew that never stood in the room. Andre carries the scope you agree to through the build, whether that scope is a backsplash, a full kitchen, a wall, or the yard.
          </p>
          <h2>What this page will not pretend</h2>
          <p>
            There is no year-in-business claim, no license number, and no award list here, because those facts are not established on this site. If they matter, ask on the call. Judge the plan for your kitchen or your yard, and jobs you can see in person.
          </p>
          <p>
            <a href="/services/#kitchens">Kitchens</a>
            <span aria-hidden="true"> · </span>
            <a href="/services/#exterior">Exterior</a>
            <span aria-hidden="true"> · </span>
            <a href="/process/">Process</a>
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
    <CtaBand
      heading="Call Andre about the kitchen or the yard."
      text="Springfield and the surrounding Central Illinois towns. Say which one you want to change."
    />
  </main>
</Base>
